//! BabyBear interpretation of the field-independent Mandelbrot schemas.
//!
//! Main rows, public statements, and Fe-derived auxiliary columns all flow
//! through the same exact-length 30-bit field encoder. Their 210, 114, and
//! 411 bits occupy 7, 4, and 14 BabyBear payload lanes respectively. The
//! largest value is absorbed by one typed, fixed-length Poseidon2 sponge.

